```csharp
public class AudioVisualizer : MonoBehaviour
{
    // ...
}
```

5. Initialize the audio visualizer:
   - In the `Start()` method, initialize the audio visualizer with the appropriate settings:

```csharp
private void Start()
{
    // Get the audio source component
    var audioSource = GetComponent<AudioSource>();

    // Initialize the audio visualizer
    var audioVisualizerComponent = gameObject.AddComponent<AudioVisualizerComponent>();
    audioVisualizerComponent.Initialize(audioSource);
}
```

6. Update the audio visualizer:
   - In the `Update()` method, update the audio visualizer with the current audio data:

```csharp
private void Update()
{
    // Get the audio source component
    var audioSource = GetComponent<AudioSource>();

    // Update the audio visualizer
    audioVisualizerComponent.Update(audioSource.outputData);
}
```

